{"data":[{"author_id":"925446092669489154","created_at":"2026-10-15T12:43:23.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110713144548979152"],"id":"2110713144548979152","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":32,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"缠论里最容易被用错的一句话：背驰了，就该反手做。\n\n这是我见过新手交的最贵的一笔学费。📉\n\n先把结论放前面：\n背驰不等于反转。它只保证一件事——回拉。\n\n背驰的本质，是「离开段」和「进入段」的力度对比：同方向、同级别，后一段的推动力明显变小了（常看 MACD 黄白线回抽 + 红绿柱面积收缩）。","url":"https://x.com/InGodWeBelieveU/status/2110713144548979152"},{"author_id":"925446092669489154","created_at":"2026-10-16T12:24:48.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111070854792507580"],"id":"2111070854792507580","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":41,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"缠论里最危险的两个字：中阴。\n\n它不是某根K线，而是「上一段趋势已经走完、下一段方向还没确认」的那段模糊地带。\n\n你以为自己在等市场给方向，其实是在赌方向。\n\n绝大多数爆亏，就发生在这种没方向的日子里——趋势里赚的钱，在中阴里加倍还回去。💸","url":"https://x.com/InGodWeBelieveU/status/2111070854792507580"},{"article":{"title":"策略库和交易骨架实测：TA-Lib 80 分，4.4 万星的 CCXT 31 分（4/5）"},"author_id":"896204154506366977","created_at":"2026-10-16T01:38:35.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110908229559665045"],"id":"2110908229559665045","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1476,"like_count":4,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"https://t.co/SBtTMFAqJ4","url":"https://x.com/xparkzz/status/2110908229559665045"},{"author_id":"923007331763392512","created_at":"2026-10-15T01:52:02.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110549225255916009"],"id":"2110549225255916009","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":37326,"like_count":3,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":1},"text":"😛🎊🌞\n【po文+po18+废文+AO3】合集\n\n🔗：\nhttps://t.co/l9f3XKUJFV\n\n作者合集：安诗鸢尾合集\n《这婚离不成了【快穿 】》作者：安诗鸢尾\n《双倍沦陷ABO》作者：安诗鸢尾\n《炮灰觊觎主角团的下场》作者：安诗鸢尾\n《笨蛋美人穿书后被bt盯上了》作者：安诗鸢尾","url":"https://x.com/myclejonson/status/2110549225255916009"},{"article":{"title":"好的写作到底是什么"},"author_id":"16681326","created_at":"2026-10-15T08:39:38.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110651803901784258"],"id":"2110651803901784258","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":127,"impression_count":8558,"like_count":62,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":16},"text":"https://t.co/jdF4YGkNFe","url":"https://x.com/lifesinger/status/2110651803901784258"},{"author_id":"1891330878393167872","created_at":"2026-10-16T14:15:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111098587866386922"],"id":"2111098587866386922","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1603,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":7,"retweet_count":0},"text":"有哪些历史冷知识，你第一次知道？\n\n1、\"小鸟依人\"最早是形容男人的。有一\n次，唐太宗和长孙无忌品评当朝人物，评\n论到著名书法家诸遂良时，唐太宗\n说：\"褚遂良鲠亮，有学术，竭诚亲于\n朕，若飞鸟依人，自加怜爱。\"意思是\n说，褚遂良是太宗的老师，他也像小鸟一\n样栖息在皇帝的身边。","url":"https://x.com/SoulSloop99/status/2111098587866386922"},{"author_id":"1585163772054081537","created_at":"2026-10-15T16:13:20.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110765979340857603"],"id":"2110765979340857603","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":29,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"《六祖坛经》「心平何劳持戒，行直何用修禅」，心本来就平正，不用刻意去守戒。它还说「善恶虽殊，本性无二」，善和恶看起来不同，背后的本性是一样的。人道规定的善良在天道意义上来说本身并不天然具有高一等的价值叙事，它也掺杂着人性中的贪嗔痴。执于善非大善，亦不是自然本真之法。老实人容易用“","url":"https://x.com/JamesPandaVC/status/2110765979340857603"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110543015442034688","3_2110543015433715712","3_2110543015542726656","3_2110543015546888192"]},"author_id":"1803349471771893765","created_at":"2026-10-15T01:27:27.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110543039798346101"],"id":"2110543039798346101","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":1867,"like_count":94,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":38,"retweet_count":11},"text":"北京法海寺你去过吗？\n大雄宝殿内，一套明代宫廷壁画技艺登峰造极，其中佛坛背后扇面墙上的\"水月观音\"最教人移不开眼。 https://t.co/JYEnNAEGtM","url":"https://x.com/EllieEllie0077/status/2110543039798346101"},{"author_id":"1592938896161001472","created_at":"2026-10-16T01:45:18.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110909921743274298"],"id":"2110909921743274298","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":36,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"《高山说缠》-今日早课之缠论解析10.16 https://t.co/WHQ9vZbz3I 来自 @YouTube","url":"https://x.com/yycl_gaoshan/status/2110909921743274298"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2111037873533444096"]},"author_id":"1592938896161001472","created_at":"2026-10-16T10:14:11.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111037986666319883"],"id":"2111037986666319883","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":44,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"全球市场进入调整周期\n市场走势节奏萎靡不振\n黄金白银低位震荡走势\n标普500高位摇摇欲坠\n今晚19:00全网缠论公开课\n缠论拆解当下走势分类与买卖点\n锁定每周一三五免费公开课\n直播地址：微博关注《高山说缠论》\n点关注不迷路~\n\n#缠论交易体系教学 https://t.co/vEVAXGfI5G","url":"https://x.com/yycl_gaoshan/status/2111037986666319883"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110908566295261184"]},"author_id":"1910907485554462720","created_at":"2026-10-16T01:39:58.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110908578676752460","2110909298637517028"],"id":"2110908578676752460","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":365,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2110183073942016084","type":"quoted"}],"text":"📚 花姐带路，100天搞懂缠论 · DAY 01\n\n缠论的第一块砖：笔。\n\n一句话记住：\n\n先找有效的顶和底，再把两个端点连起来。\n\n就这么简单。\n\n🔺 顶 → 底 = 向下笔\n🔻 底 → 顶 = 向上笔\n但注意，不是随便找个顶底一连就算数：\n\n✅ 顶底之间要有间隔，不能共用K线\n✅ 中间至少 1 根独立K线\n✅ https://t.co/ax4aqRRbzp https://t.co/wYwycoCH3v","url":"https://x.com/Cycle_King1913/status/2110908578676752460"},{"author_id":"209431348","created_at":"2026-10-16T13:30:42.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111087439955845385"],"id":"2111087439955845385","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":12,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"今天又是学习缠论的一天","url":"https://x.com/r_ranggra/status/2111087439955845385"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2111036631591337984"]},"author_id":"1544949349393874947","created_at":"2026-10-16T10:12:20.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111036636364480963","2111036870884741284","2111037519353479509"],"id":"2111037519353479509","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":767,"like_count":4,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":1},"text":"威科夫理论（Wyckoff Method）和道氏理论（Dow Theory）才是现代缠论等众多本土化交易理论的两大底层基石。对于绝大多数交易初学者而言，先学威科夫理论，再看“缠论”，才是一条更符合逻辑、也更容易理解的进化路径。 https://t.co/jbjlLn2qw0","url":"https://x.com/julianne_prada/status/2111037519353479509"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2111036631591337984"]},"author_id":"1544949349393874947","created_at":"2026-10-16T10:08:49.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111036636364480963","2111036870884741284","2111037519353479509"],"id":"2111036636364480963","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":51,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"威科夫理论（Wyckoff Method）和道氏理论（Dow Theory）确实是现代缠论等众多本土化交易理论的两大底层基石。对于绝大多数交易初学者而言，先学维科夫理论，再看“缠论”，才是一条更符合逻辑、也更容易理解的进化路径。 https://t.co/JGgnf4i6TF","url":"https://x.com/julianne_prada/status/2111036636364480963"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110908566295261184"]},"author_id":"1910907485554462720","created_at":"2026-10-16T01:42:50.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110908578676752460","2110909298637517028"],"id":"2110909298637517028","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":6,"impression_count":1683,"like_count":20,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":5},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2110183073942016084","type":"quoted"}],"text":"📚 花姐带路，100天搞懂缠论 · DAY 04\n\n缠论的第一块砖：笔。\n\n一句话记住：\n\n先找有效的顶和底，再把两个端点连起来。\n\n就这么简单。\n\n🔺 顶 → 底 = 向下笔\n🔻 底 → 顶 = 向上笔\n但注意，不是随便找个顶底一连就算数：\n\n✅ 顶底之间要有间隔，不能共用K线\n✅ 中间至少 1 根独立K线\n✅ https://t.co/sYJDOBCwSG https://t.co/wYwycoCH3v","url":"https://x.com/Cycle_King1913/status/2110909298637517028"},{"author_id":"1006745743435198465","created_at":"2026-10-16T01:16:32.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110902682726875246"],"id":"2110902682726875246","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":5,"impression_count":1239,"like_count":12,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":12,"retweet_count":4},"text":"缠论高手与普通散户的区别：\n\n新低不是买点，背驰才值得关注？\n\n很多人炒股，看到股价不断创新低，就开始觉得：\n\n跌这么多了，该反弹了吧？\n已经破位了，是不是最后一跌？\n\n但从缠论的角度看，这恰恰是最容易犯的错误。\n\n破新低，只能说明价格更低了，并不能证明下跌已经结束。","url":"https://x.com/GPYZZY/status/2110902682726875246"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2111036631591337984"]},"author_id":"1544949349393874947","created_at":"2026-10-16T10:09:45.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111036636364480963","2111036870884741284","2111037519353479509"],"id":"2111036870884741284","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":74,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"威科夫理论（Wyckoff Method）和道氏理论（Dow Theory）才是现代缠论等众多本土化交易理论的两大底层基石。对于绝大多数交易初学者而言，先学位科夫理论，再看“缠论”，才是一条更符合逻辑、也更容易理解的进化路径。 https://t.co/l4wGsyVv2J","url":"https://x.com/julianne_prada/status/2111036870884741284"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2111119918221656064","3_2111119768635990016"]},"author_id":"1592938896161001472","created_at":"2026-10-16T15:39:48.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111119929781182489"],"id":"2111119929781182489","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":30,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"缠论走势结构拆解是市场走势最精确的分析，必须把所有走势分类了然于胸，才能对市场走势有一个精确的把握。\n\nbitcoin:native https://t.co/tP6pWvz52x","url":"https://x.com/yycl_gaoshan/status/2111119929781182489"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["13_2111185162570711040"]},"author_id":"2102530725006147584","created_at":"2026-10-16T19:59:34.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111185300697514125"],"id":"2111185300697514125","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"🚃贴近你低声说话，气息交缠，耳根悄悄升温。\n【赤裸特工】原味版本\nhttps://t.co/pk2hoEdxyB\n#绿帽 #制服 #ai成人短剧 #中出👒🚨🐱 https://t.co/oA9cA9XBDG","url":"https://x.com/jvy1fip52dnri1/status/2111185300697514125"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["13_2111164477060038656"]},"author_id":"21025279