7822748959","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":26,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"如果你也总在震荡里挨打\n这条写给你——问题通常不在技术，在你把「盘整」当成了「趋势」。\n\n缠论分这两者，只用一招：数中枢。\n\n一段走势里——\n· 只出现 1 个中枢 → 盘整\n· 出现 2 个以上、方向相同的同级别中枢 → 趋势（中枢依次抬高=上涨，依次降低=下跌）\n\n就这一条线，直接决定你该干嘛：\n\n1️⃣","url":"https://x.com/InGodWeBelieveU/status/2110949137822748959"}],"includes":{"media":[{"media_key":"3_2110543015442034688","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2110543015433715712","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2110543015542726656","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2110543015546888192","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2111037873533444096","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2110908566295261184","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2111036631591337984","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2111119918221656064","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2111119768635990016","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"13_2111185162570711040","type":"video"},{"media_key":"13_2111164477060038656","type":"video"},{"media_key":"3_2110839739100110850","type":"photo"}],"users":[{"id":"925446092669489154","name":"Peter Liu, PhD｜Wealth & Wellness","username":"InGodWeBelieveU"},{"id":"896204154506366977","name":"Park","username":"xparkzz"},{"id":"923007331763392512","name":"michael mbwamboichae","username":"myclejonson"},{"id":"16681326","name":"Frank Wang 玉伯","username":"lifesinger"},{"id":"1891330878393167872","name":"心灵书舫 | SoulSloop","username":"SoulSloop99"},{"id":"1585163772054081537","name":"James TT","username":"JamesPandaVC"},{"id":"1803349471771893765","name":"ELLIE","username":"EllieEllie0077"},{"id":"1592938896161001472","name":"Crypto以缠解势","username":"yycl_gaoshan"},{"id":"1910907485554462720","name":"花解周期（退休养老版）","username":"Cycle_King1913"},{"id":"209431348","name":"币圈萌新请教诸位大佬","username":"r_ranggra"},{"id":"1544949349393874947","name":"Julianne Prada","username":"julianne_prada"},{"id":"1006745743435198465","name":"一直涨","username":"GPYZZY"},{"id":"2102530725006147584","name":"zyUfkezlA","username":